    "detailed_description": "Phantom Rose is a roguelike deckbuilding card game. Fight and collect powerful cards as Reina, a maid exploring a mansion ravaged by evil creatures.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 A Roguelike Card Adventure</h2>Build your card deck and make careful decisions while you explore as each death may be permanent.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 Manage Your Deck</h2>There's no luck-based card draw during battle. Instead, manage your card's cooldown to defeat your foe swiftly and efficiently.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 Defeat and Collect</h2>Collect over 100+ cards and powerful items by defeating phantoms &amp; rescuing other maids in distress<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 Explore Through Dangers</h2>Venture through areas of interest, danger, and place of safety to reach and defeat the crown phantoms for large rewards",
